      "series_revalidation": "4 November 2026. The four series were moved the least distance that makes every pair 0.09 or more apart in OKLab under normal, protan, deutan and tritan vision (the ukdemographics categorical rule) and passes every check of the dataviz skill validator (scripts/validate_palette.js --pairs all: lightness band, chroma floor 0.10, normal vision 15, contrast 3:1) on bg, bg-subtle and bg-card in each theme; dark hues are held to their light partners. Search: scripts/series-search.ts. Light: #1a6ba8 to #166ea5, #b45309 to #b6550f, #6d28d9 to #6e24da, #a51d5c to #9d1c5c (each moved 0.017 or less). Dark: #6aa9de to #5599cc, #e0a35c to #cf7a48, #b49cf0 to #966bfe, #e888b0 to #f83b9b. Before: dark series 1 and 3 were 0.031 apart under protan; light series 2 and 4 0.078 under tritan.",
